  invariant an OwnerContractImage references Atlas, Capability, RepresentationPassport and exact-gate owners; it cannot copy their facts or make a declared/realized command an admitted invocation
  forbidden_inference compiled OwnerContractImage -> a capability invocation is checked, authorized, or effectful
  witness cmd/BonfyreOwnerContract/Makefile builds the current 331-architecture/267-interaction frontier, requires unresolved=0 and realized_unmapped=0, emits an atomic OwnerContractImage, and verifies its schema plus exact-gate boundary; cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/bonfyre-external-estate address-worker --db ~/.bonfyre/estate/estate.db --model-db ~/.local/share/bonfyre/models.db --owner-contract-image ~/.bonfyre/estate/owner-contract-image-current.json published the current 22-model advertisement generation through that gate; cmd/BonfyreLoweringWorkers/tests/lowering_workers_test.sh compiles the consumer with the optional image gate
